<title>UK: Euromarket turnover rose in week to Sept 5 -ISMA.</title>
<headline>Euromarket turnover rose in week to Sept 5 -ISMA.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turnover in Eurobond and related markets rose to $910.33 billion in the week to September 5 from $868.62 billion the previous week, International Securities Market Association data shows (in billions of dollars):</p>
<p>					 Latest week	Previous week</p>
<p> Primary market:		    32.42		32.30</p>
<p> Of which U.S. dollar issues    18.30		17.49</p>
<p> Secondary market:		 877.91	     836.33</p>
<p> Of which U.S. dollar issues   137.36	     139.29</p>
<p> Cleared through Euroclear     659.32	     634.26</p>
<p> Cleared through Cedel	   251.01	     234.37</p>
</text>
